#. ~ Description of gun "Belgian battle rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Belgian battle rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
msgid ""
"Originally designed during the Cold War, this gun is probably the most "
"successful battle rifle ever designed.  Despite being labeled as obsolete, "
"its tunable gas system ensures both reliability and low recoil, allowing the "
"FAL to keep up even among modern competitors.  This is a semi-automatic clone"
" built by a domestic manufacturer."
msgstr ""

