#. Tac-338 rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "McMillan Tac-338 rifle" of item "AI bolt-action
#. sniper rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
msgid ""
"Chambering the .338 Lapua cartridge, the Tac-338 is a high-precision, bolt-"
"action sniper rifle that, before the Cataclysm, complemented the arsenal of "
"the US Navy Special Warfare unit.  Providing Navy SEAL marksmen with the "
"capability to land effective shots on targets at a typical range of 1600 "
"meters, a valuable capability for the long-distance engagements prevalent "
"during the US army's war on terror, the rifle comes kitted with an adjustable"
" cheek pad, butt hook, and muzzle break."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
