"Developed as a lower-cost successor to H&K's own MP5, the Universal Machine "
"Pistol is a closed-bolt, simple blowback sub-machine gun constructed of "
"lightweight polymer.  In order to make it more attractive to American police "
"departments, it was offered in .40 S&W and .45 ACP as well as the ubiquitous "
