msgid_plural "Ruger American Ranch Rifles"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of gun "Ruger American Ranch Rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Ruger American Ranch Rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/450bushmaster.json
msgid ""
"A compact, magazine-fed, bolt-action hunting rifle designed and manufactured "
"with cost-effectiveness at the peak of concerns, the Ruger American Ranch "
"Rifle series caters to shooters on a budget.  Factory chambered for the "
"powerful, though short-range, .450 Bushmaster cartridge, the weapon was able "
"to stand toe-to-toe with all native North American game despite its "
"minimalist design."
msgstr ""

